.git
.venv
venv
env
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
# Local dev DB, task/data trees (data/ can hold a live davfs2 OwnCloud mount --
# never bake that into an image). The image gets fresh empty dirs instead,
# see the Dockerfile.
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal
# Stray local redis dump from manual `redis-server`/`docker exec` runs during
# development -- never bake a host-local persisted DB into the image; a
# foreign/stale dump.rdb makes the container's own redis-server crash on
# startup with "Wrong signature trying to load DB from file".
dump.rdb
data/
tasks/
# The Dockerfile clones its own copy instead of copying whatever's checked
# out locally (submodule vs. plain clone, possibly dirty/out of sync).
stdpipe/
*.log
.env
